  <History Date="11-09-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with FW 1.1 07/2025 charts (what a mess.  completely different.  changing everything like this is not helpful to anyone.  either it shouldn't change this way or the previous charts should never have been released.  very frustrating.  pixel layout is vague at best)" Version="5" />
  <History Date="22-09-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="(re)Created from Clay Paky Tambora Glare (completely different.  changing things like this is frustrating, a waste of time and unhelpful to anyone.  no pixel layout)" Version="6" />
